Modifications in drafter/overlay
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
drafter/overlay/ contains files that replace or extend files of DeepSpec at
commit afdfa7c9382a3341a3e6f17756dd816da79f132c.  They were modified or added for
the prefix-attention drafter described in "Beyond Parallel Blindness: Information
Floors and Model Gaps in Block Drafting".  Files adapted from SpecForge that were
modified carry an in-file notice (deepspec/utils/optim.py,
scripts/data/download_and_split.py).

The DFlash2 reproduction imports, but does not include, speculators
(https://github.com/vllm-project/speculators, Apache License 2.0).

